'''Rin Tohsaka''' (遠坂 凛) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Rin Tohsaka
|image = E 373.png
|appearance = [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,250¢ - 8,887¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has very low health and attack power, decent range and sluggish attack rate so it isn't hard to kill her use any hard-hitting unit like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]].

==Strategy==
You shouldn't have too much problem dealing with Rin. The two strategies you could use is rushing her using stuff like Butterfly Cat or Maglev, or outranging her with long range cats like dragon.

